                "text": "What is the OSI Model?"
            },
            "answer": {
                "back": "The OSI (Open Systems Interconnection) Model is a conceptual framework that standardizes network communication into 7 layers:\n1. Physical\n2. Data Link\n3. Network\n4. Transport\n5. Session\n6. Presentation\n7. Application\n\nEach layer has a specific role and communicates only with the layers directly above and below it."
